		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A 10-foot-tall mechanism of gears, dials, pendulums, and other scientific apparatuses.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 40, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +6 (2d10), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -2, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Gear Blast</strong>. When reduced to 0 HP, explodes in blast of metallic shards, near-sized cube centered on golem. DEX 12+ or 2d10 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Golem</strong>. Only damaged by adamantine or magical sources. Immune to damage from fire, cold, or non-magical sources. Healed by electricity.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
